<decision #track.rename_ontology_om_class_object_contract.root {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
}
(
  <question ?>是否创建独立 track 处理 Class/Object/Field/FieldValue 存储与公开契约？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>Mission G2-T1 requires a real TrackLink for this bounded slice.</?>
    <decision-text ?>创建独立 track `rename-ontology-om-class-object-contract`，只覆盖 Class/Object/Field/FieldValue 存储和公开 API 契约。</?>
    <rationale ?>RelationLink、ComputedProp、Operation 牵涉行为、权限、registry 和 scripting，已由 mission G2-T2 单独承载。</?>
    <evidence ?>Mission design and ontology-core inventory show the rename spans schema, API, models, logic, tests, and examples.</?>
  )
  >
)
>
